---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="simple-page">
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>

    <p>
      We'd love to hear from you. Whether you have a question, feedback, a correction,
      or just want to say hello — reach out.
    </p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      General inquiries: <a href="mailto:hello@orlisseliving.com">hello@orlisseliving.com</a><br />
      Editorial: <a href="mailto:editor@orlisseliving.com">editor@orlisseliving.com</a><br />
      Privacy: <a href="mailto:privacy@orlisseliving.com">privacy@orlisseliving.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Social</h2>
    <p>
      Follow us for daily inspiration and updates. Links coming soon.
    </p>

    <h2>Work With Us</h2>
    <p>
      We're always looking for talented writers and contributors who share our passion
      for modern lifestyle. If you'd like to write for Orlisse Living, send a few writing
      samples and your areas of expertise to <a href="mailto:editor@orlisseliving.com">editor@orlisseliving.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>
      We take accuracy seriously. If you spot an error in any of our articles, please
      let us know at <a href="mailto:editor@orlisseliving.com">editor@orlisseliving.com</a>
      and we'll correct it promptly.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
